n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用启动后尝试加载配置 → 配置缺失触发 HTTP 500 错误 (CONFIG_MISSING) → 应用进程以退出码 78 终止 → Kubernetes 触发 CrashLoopBackOff 并重启\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：\n应用启动后立即访问 `/work` 路径获取配置，但因配置缺失（`CONFIG_MISSING`）抛出 500 错误并退出（退出码 78），导致 Kubernetes 触发指数退避的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。\n\n**支撑证据**：\n- **现象验证**：容器频繁重启 10 次且处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态 (fact-001696a608d0, fact-eab2a0299cfa)；\n- **失败机制**：日志显示重复的 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误，且对应 HTTP 状态码 500 (fact-0bf8c10f8ebd)；\n- **流程闭环**：Trace 数据显示该错误发生在 `GET /work` 请求中，且应用观察模式明确标记为 `config_missing_exit` (fact-10d9788ad8e5)；\n- **退出确认**：应用进程最终因该错误以退出码 78 终止 (fact-370e7a3799fe)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 50.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 50.4s (Evidence 40.5s, RCA 9.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 84.903, "metrics": {"run_id": "536ae36b499b45eb", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 84.90949487686157, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 84909.49487686157, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 67395.71452140808, "tool_calls": 18, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 36477.72765159607, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 17117.236375808716}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19564.634084701538, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 50429.577589035034, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14895.710468292236, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

